governorateId
areaId
shippingPrice (snapshot stored in backend)
shippingCalculatedAt
governorateName, areaName

❗ IMPORTANT: The system is NOT using text-based governorate/city anymore. Everything is ID-based.

🌐 API ENDPOINTS (MUST USE THESE ONLY)
1. Shipping Catalog
