GET /api/v1/users/me/addresses
3. Orders
Place Order
POST /api/v1/orders

Body:

{
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "addressId": "clwk..."
}

❗ DO NOT send shipping price from client
Backend uses:

address.shippingPrice snapshot only
📱 FEATURE REQUIREMENTS (FLUTTER IMPLEMENTATION)
1. Add Address Screen (Critical Change)

Replace current text-based governorate/city fields with:

UI Flow:
Step 1 — Load Governorates
Call:
GET /shipping/governorates
Show:
Dropdown (searchable)
Step 2 — On Governorate Select
