Total calculation:
total = subtotal + (address.shippingPrice ?? 0);
4. Checkout Behavior

When user selects address:

Read from backend:
shippingPrice
governorateName
areaName

❗ DO NOT call shipping API again unless user changes address

5. Error Handling (MANDATORY)
Handle these cases:
1. No internet
Show retry button
2. Governorates fail
Empty state + retry
3. Areas fail
Reset area dropdown

