load areas
manage selected governorate
manage selected area
optional calculate shipping
8. Checkout Integration Rule

Shipping logic source:

Source	Priority
address.shippingPrice (backend snapshot)	HIGH
calculate endpoint	UI preview only
9. IMPORTANT RULES (DO NOT BREAK)
❌ Never send governorate/city as text
❌ Never send shipping cost from Flutter to backend
